{"name":"Calligraphy","hex":"#59636a","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"calligraphy","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The art or practice of writing letters and words in a decorative style; the letters and words so written.","Any such style of decorative writing."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/calligraphy"}],"entries":[{"title":"Calligraphy","blocks":[{"text":"Calligraphy is fine handwriting as a visual art. It involves the design and execution of lettering or characters using a pen, ink brush, or other writing instruments. Classical calligraphy differs from type design and non-classical hand-lettering, though some calligraphers may practice both."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Letter_by_Ouyang_Xiu.jpg/330px-Letter_by_Ouyang_Xiu.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calligraphy"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/%D8%B3%D9%88%D8%B1%D8%A9_%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A3%D8%B9%D8%B1%D8%A7%D9%81_%D9%85%D9%83%D8%AA%D9%88%D8%A8%D8%A9_%D8%A8%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AE%D8%B7_%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B3%D9%88%D9%82%D9%8A_%D9%A3.jpg/500px-%D8%B3%D9%88%D8%B1%D8%A9_%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A3%D8%B9%D8%B1%D8%A7%D9%81_%D9%85%D9%83%D8%AA%D9%88%D8%A8%D8%A9_%D8%A8%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AE%D8%B7_%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B3%D9%88%D9%82%D9%8A_%D9%A3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/%D8%B3%D9%88%D8%B1%D8%A9_%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A3%D8%B9%D8%B1%D8%A7%D9%81_%D9%85%D9%83%D8%AA%D9%88%D8%A8%D8%A9_%D8%A8%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AE%D8%B7_%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B3%D9%88%D9%82%D9%8A_%D9%A3.jpg/1280px-%D8%B3%D9%88%D8%B1%D8%A9_%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A3%D8%B9%D8%B1%D8%A7%D9%81_%D9%85%D9%83%D8%AA%D9%88%D8%A8%D8%A9_%D8%A8%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AE%D8%B7_%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B3%D9%88%D9%82%D9%8A_%D9%A3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"http